            "detailed_description": "MagixHome VR is an experimental home design game where you can use your VR headset to explore and design your own virtual room. <br>You can add new furniture, change wall and furniture material, teleport across the room, or even toss things around. <br>Use MagixHome VR as a solitary escape, an interior design experiment or a place to juggle sofas! <br><br><strong>Features </strong><br>- Design your own room easily and see the magic transforms it to a realistic photos <br>- Browse unique furniture and see if you love them before any purchase <br>- Play around with multiple interesting floorplans from around the globe <br>- Give a virtual tour of your dream home to your friends remotely",
